<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="1919134618"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1801414178"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="星の約束"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Poppin'Party"/><amll:meta key="album" value="ぽっぴん'どりーむ！"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="04:05.498"><div begin="00:05.133" end="03:34.135"><p begin="00:05.133" end="00:10.515" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">lalalala...</p><p begin="00:19.674" end="00:22.022" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">耳を澄ましてみた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仔细倾听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mi wo su ma shi te mi ta</span></p><p begin="00:22.807" end="00:28.114" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">夜空の声は 今でもきっと呼んでる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">夜空的声音此刻定在呼唤</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yo zo ra no ko e wa i ma de mo ki 't to yo n de ru</span></p><p begin="00:28.321" end="00:29.946" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">(――ねえ 聞こえる?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(――呐 你听见了吗?)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">―― ne e ki ko e ru ?</span></p><p begin="00:30.835" end="00:36.047" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">辿り 追いかけてた 夢の物語は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追溯 追逐的梦想故事</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta do ri o i ka ke te ta yu me no mo no ga ta ri wa</span></p><p begin="00:36.573" end="00:38.904" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">まだ終わりそうもないね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">还不能结束呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da o wa ri so u mo na i ne</span></p><p begin="00:41.695" end="00:44.378" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">(いつもキミを)感じていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(无论何时)都能感觉到你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( i tsu mo ki mi wo )ka n ji te i ta</span></p><p begin="00:44.418" end="00:46.885" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">(今もキミに)ときめいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(如今依旧)对你悸动心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( i ma mo ki mi ni )to ki me i te</span></p><p begin="00:47.559" end="00:52.419" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">胸焦がした あの頃のままで――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">内心焦灼 一如那时――</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne ko ga shi ta a no ko ro no ma ma de ――</span></p><p begin="00:53.750" end="00:55.834" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">星の約束 煌めいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰的约定 莹莹闪烁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi no ya ku so ku ki ra me i te</span></p><p begin="00:56.322" end="00:58.501" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">わたしたちに降り注いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向我们倾洒而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi ni fu ri so so i da</span></p><p begin="00:59.570" end="01:01.919" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">夢みながら走っていた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">怀着美梦努力奔跑</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me mi na ga ra ha shi 't te i ta</span></p><p begin="01:02.275" end="01:06.382" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">繋いだ指と指を その先に繋ごう<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">将相牵的指尖 与未来相连</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i ta yu bi to yu bi wo so no sa ki ni tsu na go u</span></p><p begin="01:06.687" end="01:09.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">星の約束 瞬いた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星之约定 闪闪发光</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi no ya ku so ku ma ta ta i ta</span></p><p begin="01:10.019" end="01:12.316" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">手を伸ばせば届きそうだね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似乎触手可及</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te wo no ba se ba to do ki so u da ne</span></p><p begin="01:13.158" end="01:15.439" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">(まだ見えない)未来へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(去往)还不可见的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ma da mi e na i )mi ra i he</span></p><p begin="01:15.869" end="01:18.418" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">(ずっとずっと)声あわせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(永远永远)其声合唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( zu 't to zu 't to )ko e a wa se te</span></p><p begin="01:19.159" end="01:20.935" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">続くよ 星の鼓動(STAR BEAT)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星星的心跳 会永远延续</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu zu ku yo 《STAR BEAT》</span></p><p begin="01:21.408" end="01:25.157" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">永遠を感じた夜に――。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这感受到永恒的夜里――</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e i e n wo ka n ji ta yo ru ni ――</span></p><p begin="01:29.674" end="01:32.006" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">道に迷ったとき<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">当迷失方向时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi chi ni ma yo 't ta to ki</span></p><p begin="01:32.738" end="01:37.979" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">始まりの歌 口ずさんで 目を閉じる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">闭上眼睛 嘴里哼起起始的歌谣</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ji ma ri no u ta ku chi zu sa n de me wo to ji ru</span></p><p begin="01:38.232" end="01:39.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">(――ねえ 聞こえた?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(――呐 你听见了吗?)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">―― ne e ki ko e ta ?</span></p><p begin="01:40.579" end="01:43.044" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">「ずっとそのままで」って<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">“请永远保持初心”</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">「 zu 't to so no ma ma de 」 't te</span></p><p begin="01:43.724" end="01:45.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">あの頃のあなたに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">真想对</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ko ro no a na ta ni</span></p><p begin="01:46.522" end="01:48.936" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">声をかけてあげたいな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那时候的你说话啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko e wo ka ke te a ge ta i na</span></p><p begin="01:51.619" end="01:54.094" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">(キミはいつも)寄り添ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(你无论何时)都与我相依相偎</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ki mi wa i tsu mo )yo ri so 't te ru</span></p><p begin="01:54.396" end="01:56.862" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">(今もキミは)揺るがずに<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(如今你依旧)不曾动摇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( i ma mo ki mi wa )yu ru ga zu ni</span></p><p begin="01:57.487" end="02:02.242" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">空見上げた 憧れのままで――<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仰望天空 一如曾经的憧憬――</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra mi a ge ta a ko ga re no ma ma de ――</span></p><p begin="02:03.522" end="02:05.855" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">星の約束 巡ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星之约定 来回逡巡</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi no ya ku so ku me gu 't te ru</span></p><p begin="02:06.303" end="02:08.449" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">広がり続ける世界で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这不断扩张的世界</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ro ga ri tsu zu ke ru se ka i de</span></p><p begin="02:09.396" end="02:11.878" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">胸の奥で通じあってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们在心中心意相通</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mu ne no o ku de tsu u ji a 't te ru</span></p><p begin="02:12.200" end="02:16.158" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">繋いだ歌と歌は わたしたちの絆<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相连的歌声便是我们的羁绊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na i da u ta to u ta wa wa ta shi ta chi no ki zu na</span></p><p begin="02:16.656" end="02:19.473" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">星の約束 交わそうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星之约定 来交换吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi no ya ku so ku ka wa so u yo</span></p><p begin="02:19.997" end="02:22.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">ただ一つの願いだから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这是唯一的心愿</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ta da hi to tsu no ne ga i da ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:23.108" end="02:25.401" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">(きらきらした)明日へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(向着)闪闪发光的明天进发</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ki ra ki ra shi ta )a shi ta he</span></p><p begin="02:25.891" end="02:28.391" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">(どきどきして)飛びこもうよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(心跳怦然)起飞翱翔吧</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( do ki do ki shi te )to bi ko mo u yo</span></p><p begin="02:29.029" end="02:30.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">信じた 星の鼓動(STAR BEAT)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相信 星星的心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">shi n ji ta 《STAR BEAT》</span></p><p begin="02:31.165" end="02:35.188" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">"これから" を感じた夜に――。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在感受到“今后”的夜里――</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">“ ko re ka ra ” wo ka n ji ta yo ru ni ――</span></p><p begin="02:36.272" end="02:40.340" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">夢は終わらないから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">梦不会终结</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">yu me wa o wa ra na i ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:42.266" end="02:44.010" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">耳を澄ましてみる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">侧耳倾听</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi mi wo su ma shi te mi ru</span></p><p begin="02:45.669" end="02:49.387" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">(ねえ......ねえキミ......)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(呐 呐 你啊)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ne e ki mi</span></p><p begin="02:51.165" end="02:55.194" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">(ねえ......聞こえるかな?)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(呐 你能听见吗?)</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ne e ki ko e ru ka na ?</span></p><p begin="03:02.525" end="03:04.772" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">星の約束 誓ってる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星之约定 正在起誓</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi no ya ku so ku chi ka 't te ru</span></p><p begin="03:05.159" end="03:07.522" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">不意に涙がこぼれてた<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无意间眼泪滴落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i ni na mi da ga ko bo re te ta</span></p><p begin="03:08.356" end="03:10.836" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">上手く言えなくてごめんね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">抱歉我无法准确表达</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u ma ku i e na ku te go me n ne</span></p><p begin="03:11.165" end="03:12.909" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">見つめてる 夢みてる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仔细凝视 做着美梦</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi tsu me te ru yu me mi te ru</span></p><p begin="03:13.817" end="03:15.376" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">愛し続けている<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">继续去爱着</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a i shi tsu zu ke te i ru</span></p><p begin="03:15.689" end="03:18.455" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">星の約束 煌めいて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">星辰的约定 莹莹闪烁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho shi no ya ku so ku ki ra me i te</span></p><p begin="03:18.902" end="03:21.166" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">わたしたちに降り注いだ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">向我们倾洒而来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">wa ta shi ta chi ni fu ri so so i da</span></p><p begin="03:22.078" end="03:24.491" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">(まだ見えない)未来へ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(去往)还不可见的未来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( ma da mi e na i )mi ra i he</span></p><p begin="03:24.847" end="03:27.335" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">(ずっとずっと)声あわせて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">(永远永远)其声合唱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">( zu 't to zu 't to )ko e a wa se te</span></p><p begin="03:27.997" end="03:29.780" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">繋ごう 星の鼓動(STAR BEAT)<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">相连吧 星星的心跳</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu na go u 《STAR BEAT》</span></p><p begin="03:30.250" end="03:34.135" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">永遠を感じた夜に――。<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在这感受到永恒的夜里――</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">e i e n wo ka n ji ta yo ru ni ――</span></p></div></body></tt>